{"id":"act50side_level_act50side_04_beg","steps":[{"t":"cmd","c":"header","a":{"key":"title_test","is_skippable":true,"fit_mode":"BLACK_MASK"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"stopmusic","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"background","a":{"image":"71_g4_bambooforest","screenadapt":"coverall"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":2,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playmusic","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/Music/AVG/m_avg_normal_loop","volume":0.6}},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"image","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"background","a":{"image":"71_g5_snowymountpath","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":2}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_avg_snowbootwalk"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":2}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#4$2","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Catapult","text":"Mmm! Those Bunny Dango were delicious! Really warmed me up! I feel like I'm at full power!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$7","focus":"m"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/CustomSE/act50side/act50side_otomo000_vo_type01_pitch0_attack_alt01","volume":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Masamune","text":"Of course it would! They don't just fill your stomach, different flavors can give hunters all sorts of mewsterious effects!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#6$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"stopmusic","a":{"fadetime":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Orchid","text":"I have... a bad feeling. Something about this place doesn't feel right at all."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#9$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Hofukaru","text":"'Tis the scent of the curse. It thickens as we advance."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#6$2","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Catapult","text":"Hmm? Hey guys, doesn't it feel like... not all that cold?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#4$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Orchid","text":"You're not imagining things. Look under your feet!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{}},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"Everyone looks down to see the thick snow beneath their feet melting away before their eyes, exposing the black volcanic rock underneath."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"The air around them quickly begins to heat up and dry out, filling with the scent of sulfur."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$4","focus":"m"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/CustomSE/act50side/act50side_otomo000_vo_type01_pitch0_attack_alt03","volume":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Masamune","text":"What's going on?! How could the meowntain turn into a volcano?!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#9$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Hofukaru","text":"The Iju's curse... With its power, it hath transformed the environment into an arena befitting it."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_gen_smallearthquake","volume":0.6}},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":2,"xstrength":4,"ystrength":4,"vibrato":20,"randomness":30,"fadeout":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playmusic","a":{"intro":"Sound_Beta_2/Music/act9d0d0/m_avg_nervous_intro","key":"Sound_Beta_2/Music/act9d0d0/m_avg_nervous_loop","volume":0.4}},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"From the distant snow-capped peak shoots a gout of flame, followed by boiling waves of lava that flow down the slope, transforming the white snow into an eye-searing red."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#7$2","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Catapult","text":"WHOA! It's erupting!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#1$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Hofukaru","text":"I can sense a great cauldron of energy brewing within the mount... It must be the Escorchgot using the power of the curse to transform it into a volcano!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#5$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Hofukaru","text":"No... There is more than one source..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#6$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Hofukaru","text":"There are two sources of power! The one within the mountain is simply the larger one!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#4$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Orchid","text":"What?!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#6$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Hofukaru","text":"We must stop it!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":2,"xstrength":25,"ystrength":25,"vibrato":30,"randomness":90,"fadeout":true,"block":false}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_avg_erthshkng","loop":false,"channel":"bgs","volume":0.3}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_avg_rockfall","volume":0.6}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_gen_smallearthquake","volume":0.6}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_avg_rockfall","volume":0.6}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_avg_erthshkng","volume":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1.5}},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"Suddenly, the ground beneath them splits, creating a yawning chasm. Molten lava spurts out, separating the group in an instant."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#5$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Hofukaru","text":"Madam Orchid! Madam Catapult!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#8$2","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Catapult","text":"Orchid! Hofukaru, she—"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#10$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Orchid","text":"Tch, to think it had a trick like this up its sleeve."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#8$2","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Catapult","text":"Wirebug—Wait, no, there's too much lava in the way. The Wirebugs can't get past!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#9$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Hofukaru","text":"...It seems I have no other choice."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#9$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Hofukaru","text":"I shall take on the source within the mountain alone! You two need only defend yourselves!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_avg_snowrun","volume":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"duration":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":2}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#9$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Orchid","text":"Hofukaru, wait!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#9$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Orchid","text":"Why does that girl always insist on trying to do everything by herself?!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#8$2","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Catapult","text":"Orchid!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2104_1#1$2","focus":"m","duration":2}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":3}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$5","focus":"m"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/CustomSE/act50side/act50side_otomo000_vo_type01_pitch0_attack_alt03","volume":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Masamune","text":"This is purr-fect."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$5","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Masamune","text":"Let's take this op-purr-tunity to see how much of your training stuck. We'll hang back, Yoshitsune."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyD_1#1$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/CustomSE/act50side/act50side_otomo_dog_vo_type01_pitch0_attack_size03_alt01","volume":0.8}},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"Yoshitsune lets out a gloomy growl, as if to say: 'Don't disappoint us.'"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#7$2","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Catapult","text":"Huh? You're not coming with?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$5","focus":"m"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/CustomSE/act50side/act50side_otomo000_vo_type01_pitch0_attack_alt03","volume":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Masamune","text":"This will be your furst test! It will prove whether you're qualified to be called a hunter!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#9$2","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Orchid","text":"Are you ready, Catapult?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#9$2","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Catapult","text":"Ha, do you even need to ask?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#9$2","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Orchid","text":"I'll use an arcing shot to pin it down. You look for a chance to take out its foot!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#9$2","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Catapult","text":"Got it! I'll use Morph Slash to close in!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_avg_snowrun","volume":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":2}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2104_1#1$2","focus":"m"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/CustomSE/act50side/act50side_pl_wp_caxe_imp_draw_start"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":0.4}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/CustomSE/act50side/act50side_pl_wp_caxe_102_whoosh_a_alt_01"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":1,"g":1,"b":1,"fadetime":0.05,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0.5,"block":false}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/CustomSE/act50side/act50side_hit_slash_big_weapon_max_alt_01"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"effect","a":{"name":"AVG_036_daoguang_01","x":120.1,"y":-103.4,"rox":-40.2,"roy":145,"roz":96,"layer":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":0.5,"ystrength":40,"xstrength":40,"vibrato":30,"randomness":90,"fadeout":true,"block":false}},{"t":"cmd","c":"effect","a":{"name":"AVG_daoguang_guiji_03_blue","x":-1,"y":8.3,"rox":78,"roy":-50,"roz":-112,"yscale":1,"layer":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/CustomSE/act50side/act50side_pl_wp_caxe_imp_switch"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/CustomSE/act50side/act50side_pl_wp_caxe_imp_draw"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":0.7}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/CustomSE/act50side/act50side_pl_wp_caxe_shield_whoosh_a_alt_01"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":0.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/CustomSE/act50side/act50side_pl_wp_caxe_102_whoosh_c_alt_01"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/CustomSE/act50side/act50side_pl_wp_caxe_epv_flash_lv1_v2"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"play