why you keep your distance. Your arrows are spot-on, but mew seem to be subconsciously backing away from danger."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#10$2","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Orchid","text":"(They got me there.)"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2104_1#1$2","focus":"m"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":2,"xstrength":60,"ystrength":60,"vibrato":70,"randomness":80,"fadeout":true,"block":false}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_gen_smallearthquake","volume":0.6}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":2}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#8$2","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Catapult","text":"Orchid! It's about to spray fire!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#5$2","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Orchid","text":"Dodge it! It's too strong—you can't block it!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#8$2","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Catapult","text":"No, I gotta try! The guide said that if you want the strongest charge blade, you need to take on the strongest attacks!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$6","focus":"m"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/CustomSE/act50side/act50side_otomo000_vo_type01_pitch0_attack_alt03","volume":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Masamune","text":"You fool! Don't rush in!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$6","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Masamune","text":"(I can't believe that idiot took the lava cannon head-on!)"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/CustomSE/act50side/act50side_pl_wp_c_axe_epv_counter_full_charge_success_st"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{